{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of trading used (or stolen) cars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Got little money and nothing to lose? We were waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Used Cars Simulator</strong>, you\u2019ll fix up cars, put them up for sale, grow your business in an old shed, drive around an abandoned city, drink beer, and wander the desert with a metal detector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And it all starts when you meet a beautiful woman in a red dress at your favorite bar\u2026 Are you in?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>FIND A GOOD OFFER</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/offering.gif?t=1752836533\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Used Cars Simulator</strong>, you'll learn how to make money by trading cars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First, find a good deal. Check the car\u2019s condition, negotiate the price, and if everything looks good - just buy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>FIX THE CAR</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/flip.gif?t=1752836533\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fix the dents, order and install missing parts, wash the car, repaint it, and put it up for sale. If it wasn\u2019t yours, you\u2019d probably want to buy it yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>BE BAD</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/bebad.gif?t=1752836533\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Used Cars Simulator,</strong> there are many ways to get cars. Are they all legal? Sure - as long as the cops don\u2019t catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>HAVE FUN</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/fun.gif?t=1752836533\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After work, have some fun - drift, jump, and compare your scores with other players on the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>PROGRESS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What\u2019s coming in future updates? You tell us! Let us know which features we should add.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features of Used Cars Simulator:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Car Trading &amp; Flipping</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Story &amp; Quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Physics &amp; Sandbox</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Illegal Activities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Police Interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 World Exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Upgrades &amp; Economy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Buy A Car","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2637940/ffc9ed9f116a01ca0c52f3d3df856738f283cb12.jpg"},{"name":"Load A Car Onto The Tow Truck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2637940/1b1beee7091f54a5743b733fc9543251ccefd11d.jpg"},{"name":"Find All 3 Rubber Ducks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2637940/7325fff0b56df2a175722692ee8384e63b224ca7.jpg"},{"name":"Have $10,000 In Cash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2637940/6a0a04b30c65c11882aba24a178691b71c274663.jpg"},{"name":"Have $50,000 In Cash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2637940/bb851e4ad767f61bbbb938fb56c380cf0e8f282a.jpg"},{"name":"Have $100,000 In Cash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2637940/ad0deed493856cbf64ff52b79bc2062e03331ced.jpg"},{"name":"Have $500,000 In Cash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2637940/38c4b867f58ebec1248724e163e563e99ba85538.jpg"},{"name":"Have $1,000,000 In Cash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2637940/24482a227d050cafd56865b8438cefef2684aa9e.jpg"},{"name":"Reach Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2637940/c609381e58030945bb38b71ebedebcc5aef632de.jpg"},{"name":"Reach Level 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2637940/92a3a4980a61a0f54b174ba2dab50de6f96aa6f8.jpg"}],"total":77},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2637940?t=1752836533","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2637940?t=1752836533","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/f421c44acbf4484a7786f7310813d93ef0e6ed5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752836533","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/f421c44acbf4484a7786f7310813d93ef0e6ed5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752836533","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>EARLY ACCESS ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/b8d3e5607cfbdf1a5296b689ca820162.avif?t=1752836533\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of trading used (or stolen) cars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Got little money and nothing to lose? We were waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Used Cars Simulator</strong>, you\u2019ll fix up cars, put them up for sale, grow your business in an old shed, drive around an abandoned city, drink beer, and wander the desert with a metal detector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And it all starts when you meet a beautiful woman in a red dress at your favorite bar\u2026 Are you in?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>FIND A GOOD OFFER</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/offering.gif?t=1752836533\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Used Cars Simulator</strong>, you'll learn how to make money by trading cars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First, find a good deal. Check the car\u2019s condition, negotiate the price, and if everything looks good - just buy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>FIX THE CAR</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/flip.gif?t=1752836533\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fix the dents, order and install missing parts, wash the car, repaint it, and put it up for sale. If it wasn\u2019t yours, you\u2019d probably want to buy it yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>BE BAD</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/bebad.gif?t=1752836533\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Used Cars Simulator,</strong> there are many ways to get cars. Are they all legal? Sure - as long as the cops don\u2019t catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>HAVE FUN</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/extras/fun.gif?t=1752836533\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After work, have some fun - drift, jump, and compare your scores with other players on the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>PROGRESS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What\u2019s coming in future updates? You tell us! Let us know which features we should add.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features of Used Cars Simulator:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Car Trading &amp; Flipping</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Story &amp; Quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Physics &amp; Sandbox</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Illegal Activities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Police Interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 World Exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Upgrades &amp; Economy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["DreamWay Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637940/d82b9b4c2fbd37bf0a7834929a271436f1a05a20/header.jpg?t=1752836533","is_free":false,"linux_requi